{"id":1746355,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-10T12:07:28.474Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1746355,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Misi Dania Cun","overview":"# Translation  This tells the story of the challenges faced by a woman serving as a Village Nurse. Dania is offered a position as a nurse in a remote rural area of the country. She initially refuses but later accepts it as a challenge after being persuaded by her father, Zakariah. After registering at the clinic, Dania becomes close friends with Nurse Ilya and Nurse Nisa. Dania's diligent and responsible attitude in providing medical services to the villagers makes her well-liked by many. Her first case comes when she faces a woman who relies heavily on traditional medicine methods, a traditional healer known as Pak Landak. Despite receiving stern warnings from the healer, Dania remains firm that Pak Landak's actions are wrong. Dania becomes close friends with Dr. Dani, who is newly posted there. Nurse Dania and Dr. Dani successfully save the birth of a baby at the clinic and encourage the village community to use the clinic's services.","popularity":0.0214,"poster_path":"/6gt4lb1lqBRX2Rt6zMMQwSz1RZT.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":305998,"logo_path":null,"name":"Pentas Wayang Productions Sdn Bhd","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2019-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Misi Dania Cun","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2075907,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Niena Baharun","original_name":"Niena Baharun","popularity":0.6437,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a7874336c20d4fa2e4f09a3","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1861601,"known_for_d